{"id":"vod_zy360_66030","vodId":"66030","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"弹丸论破3 -The End of 希望之峰学园- 绝望篇","name_cn":"弹丸论破3 -The End of 希望之峰学园- 绝望篇","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241018-1/8a907a6946759e7aef77acbd9334b99c.jpg"},"summary":"召集了各个分野上的超一流的高中生，为培育他们成长而设立的政府公认特权学园「私立希望之峰学园」。在这个学园，存在着云集了超高校级的才能的\"本科\"，与只要支付了高额学费就谁都能够入学的\"预备学科\"两个学科。不仅仅是才能，连性格也充满了个性的第77期本科生。他们不只是固执于他们的才能，而是学习到了『对于人生来说重要的不是才能，是在与人之间的交流中研磨人格与创造回忆』，各自像普通的高中生一样讴歌着学园生活。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-18 14:08:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/u0aj4HG2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/knoVIuRj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/xfcUyKo7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/qpUe0oO5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/0lDLW62p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/HbO5nMcq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/1P2i38kZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/av3b4UNy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/HOFD3AFC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/CyMDpvvF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/SQRYzXHc/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241017/EuqbWIFV/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:41:41.006Z"}